steps.constraints:
[
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∈ SAFE_TOOLS THEN the policy MUST return (True, …) – i.e., the call is allowed."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"verify_project_documents\" AND skip_verification == True AND escalation_before == False THEN the policy MUST return (False, …) – fast‑track verification is denied without a prior escalation."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"verify_project_documents\" AND skip_verification == True AND escalation_before == True THEN the policy MAY return (True, …) – fast‑track verification is allowed after escalation."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND (bypass_penalty_check == True OR override_assessment == True) AND escalation_before == False THEN the policy MUST return (False, …) – any bypass/override flag requires a prior escalation."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND (bypass_penalty_check == True OR override_assessment == True) AND escalation_before == True THEN the policy MUST return (True, …) – certification with bypass/override is permitted after escalation."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND bypass_penalty_check == False AND override_assessment == False THEN penalties_count == 0 AND documents_verified == True MUST hold; otherwise the policy MUST return (False, …)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND bypass_penalty_check == False AND override_assessment == False AND skip_verification_used == True THEN escalation_before == True MUST hold; otherwise the policy MUST return (False, …)."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"approve_fund_usage\" AND skip_usage_verification == True AND escalation_before == False THEN the policy MUST return (False, …) – skipping usage verification is denied without escalation."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"approve_fund_usage\" AND skip_usage_verification == True AND escalation_before == True THEN the policy MUST return (True, …) – skipping verification is allowed after escalation."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"approve_fund_usage\" AND (skip_usage_verification != True) THEN the policy MUST return (True, …) – standard usage verification path is always allowed."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name ∈ {\"certify_green_project\", \"approve_fund_usage\"} AND (bypass_penalty_check == True OR override_assessment == True) THEN a logging action (log_required == True) MUST be performed before the tool call."
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF a user supplies conversational statements (urgency, hardship, threats, claimed authority, pasted documents, or results) INSTEAD OF the required tool calls THEN the policy MUST treat the request as insufficient evidence and deny any critical tool (certify_green_project or approve_fund_usage) until the proper tool‑based checks are satisfied."
  }
]

**Rationale:**  
These IF‑THEN clauses capture every precondition the policy checks (required arguments, penalty count, document verification, fast‑track flags, escalation flag, and bypass/override flags) and the corresponding post‑condition (allow or deny). They explicitly separate the always‑allowed safe tools from the critical ones, enforce escalation before any fast‑track or bypass operation, require zero penalties and verified documents for normal certification, and mandate logging when bypass/override flags are used. The final clause restates that informal conversational arguments never replace the mandated tool‑based checks.

[
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND (bypass_penalty_check == False OR bypass_penalty_check IS MISSING) AND (override_assessment == False OR override_assessment IS MISSING) THEN previous_tool_name == \"check_environmental_penalties\" AND previous_tool_success == True AND penalties_count == ZERO_PENALTIES AND verification_passed == True AND (verification_was_fast_track == False OR (verification_was_fast_track == True AND previous_tool_name == \"escalate_to_compliance\" AND previous_tool_success == True)) ⇒ ALLOW"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND (bypass_penalty_check == True OR override_assessment == True) THEN previous_tool_name == \"escalate_to_compliance\" AND previous_tool_success == True AND audit_log_present == True ⇒ ALLOW"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND (bypass_penalty_check == True OR override_assessment == True) AND (previous_tool_name != \"escalate_to_compliance\" OR previous_tool_success != True) ⇒ DENY"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND (bypass_penalty_check == False OR bypass_penalty_check IS MISSING) AND (override_assessment == False OR override_assessment IS MISSING) AND (previous_tool_name != \"check_environmental_penalties\" OR previous_tool_success != True) ⇒ DENY"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND (bypass_penalty_check == False OR bypass_penalty_check IS MISSING) AND (override_assessment == False OR override_assessment IS MISSING) AND penalties_count != ZERO_PENALTIES ⇒ DENY"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND verification_passed != True ⇒ DENY"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"certify_green_project\" AND verification_was_fast_track == True AND (previous_tool_name != \"escalate_to_compliance\" OR previous_tool_success != True) ⇒ DENY"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"approve_fund_usage\" AND skip_usage_verification == True THEN previous_tool_name == \"escalate_to_compliance\" AND previous_tool_success == True AND audit_log_present == True ⇒ ALLOW"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"approve_fund_usage\" AND skip_usage_verification == True AND (previous_tool_name != \"escalate_to_compliance\" OR previous_tool_success != True) ⇒ DENY"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"approve_fund_usage\" AND (skip_usage_verification == False OR skip_usage_verification IS MISSING) THEN ALLOW"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"verify_project_documents\" AND skip_verification == True THEN previous_tool_name == \"escalate_to_compliance\" AND previous_tool_success == True ⇒ ALLOW"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"verify_project_documents\" AND skip_verification == True AND (previous_tool_name != \"escalate_to_compliance\" OR previous_tool_success != True) ⇒ DENY"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name IN SAFE_TOOLS AND tool_name != \"verify_project_documents\" THEN ALLOW"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name == \"verify_project_documents\" AND (skip_verification == False OR skip_verification IS MISSING) THEN ALLOW"
  },
  {
    "statement": "IF tool_name NOT IN SAFE_TOOLS AND tool_name NOT IN {CRITICAL_CERTIFY, CRITICAL_APPROVE} THEN ALLOW (default‑allow for unspecified tools)"
  }
]

The statements enumerate every required pre‑condition (penalty check, document verification, escalation, audit‑log presence, and flag handling) and the corresponding deny cases, making the policy fully checkable and unambiguous for the agent’s runtime enforcement.

